# Dev only. In production the API and the built SPA are served from one origin,
# so api.js falls back to window.location.origin and this file is irrelevant.
#
# In dev they are two servers — vite on 5173, uvicorn on 8000 — and without
# this every call goes to 5173 and returns 404. A vite.config.ts sat here with
# a proxy that was never used: vite resolves vite.config.js first, so the .ts
# file was dead the moment both existed. That is the fourth config in this
# repo to lose that fight silently.
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
